14. COMPRESSION
-----------------

Compression ka matlab hota hai HTTP Request ya Response ke size ko
kam karna before transmitting it over the network.

Iska primary purpose hai:

    - Network bandwidth reduce karna jiski wajah se response fast milta hai usse Overall network performance improve hota hai.


## WITHOUT COMPRESSION
-----------------------

Suppose Backend Service response return karti hai:

    500 KB JSON

Flow:

        Backend service
           |
        500 KB
           |
        Service LB
           |
        API Gateway
           |
        Internet
           |
         Client


Poora 500 KB network ke through transfer hoga.


## WITH COMPRESSION
--------------------

API Gateway response ko GZIP ya Brotli jaise compression
algorithms use karke compress kar sakta hai.

Example:

        Backend Service
           |
        500 KB JSON
           |
        Service LB
           |
      API Gateway (GZIP / Brotli)
           |
         50 KB
           |
        Internet
           |
         Client


Client ka Browser ya HTTP Client automatically compressed
response ko decompress kar deta hai.

Application Developer ko manually decompression
karne ki zarurat nahi padti.


